  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 1850 0 R
  /Alt (Two rows of three panels, rows for rho 0.50 and 0.75, columns for misfitting items at about -2, -1 and 0 logits, each plotting detection against sample size for infit with Westfall-Young and the S-X2 bootstrap. Detection is lowest for the item at -2 logits in both rows. At rho = 0.75 infit is well above the S-X2 bootstrap for every item, most of all for the two items nearer the centre.)
