2146 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 2145 0 R
  /Alt (Five panels, one per combination of number of misfitting items and dimension correlation, each plotting detection rate from 0 to 100 percent against sample size for four methods. Detection rises with n in every panel. Infit with Westfall-Young is highest or tied in every panel. The S-X2 bootstrap and S-X2 with df + 1 lag behind infit most in the two panels with rho = 0.75, catching up only where all methods reach 100 percent. RMSEA above .05 is high at n = 150 and falls with n in the rho = 0.75 panels.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [0]
  /Pg 3237 0 R
>>
